  "description": "meme-id: your_new_name_is_abdul; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person's hands chained and resting on a blank sheet of paper with pencils, juxtaposed with the text 'your new name is abdul you'll take it and like it cracker.' This visual metaphor, combined with the text, implies forced identity change and dehumanization, targeting individuals of Muslim or Arab descent. The term 'cracker' is a derogatory racial slur historically used against Black people, and its use here, alongside the name 'Abdul,' which is commonly associated with Muslim or Arab heritage, constitutes a hateful attack based on ethnicity and religion. The overall intent is to demean and dehumanize a specific group through racist and Islamophobic stereotypes, using visual and textual elements to reinforce harmful biases.",
